時には涙してまた笑い合いたい
Wanting to shed tears at times and laugh together again

742
00:59:44,488 --> 00:59:47,288
同じ未来を見ていたい
I want to see the same future

743
00:59:47,288 --> 00:59:52,288
あの夢手にしたい
I want to hold that dream in my hands

744
00:59:52,488 --> 00:59:59,588
踏み出そう奇跡の一歩を
Let's take that miraculous step forward

745
01:00:00,216 --> 01:00:03,646
ああ もう一度 気持ちが溢れ出すよ
Ah, once again, feelings are overflowing.

746
01:00:03,896 --> 01:00:08,896
形あるものが 色褪せる前に この鼓動を鳴らし続けたい
Before things of form fade away, I want to keep making this heartbeat echo.

747
01:00:09,296 --> 01:00:13,646
終わらない世界に飛び出そう
Let's leap into a never-ending world.

748
01:00:13,646 --> 01:00:18,296
終わらない世界に溢れ出すよ
Overflowing into a never-ending world—

749
01:00:19,096 --> 01:00:22,296
笑顔出し
bringing out smiles!

750
01:00:22,296 --> 01:00:27,596
憧れの舞台たちと らしく輝きたい
Standing on the stage of our dreams, wanting to shine in our own way.

751
01:00:28,096 --> 01:00:33,396
時に涙して また笑い合いたい
Shedding tears at times, and wanting to laugh together again.

752
01:00:34,096 --> 01:00:37,596
同じ未来を見たい
Wanting to see the same future,

753
01:00:37,596 --> 01:00:40,596
あの夢手にしたい
wanting to make that dream ours.

754
01:00:40,596 --> 01:00:45,096
奇跡の一歩を
Taking a miraculous step forward—

755
01:00:47,096 --> 01:00:52,096
話は止まらない
The stories won't stop,

756
01:00:52,096 --> 01:00:57,596
どこまでも越えていく 世界に見せてあげる
going beyond anywhere, showing it to the world.

757
01:00:58,096 --> 01:01:04,096
アクセスしてみない？
Won't you try accessing it?

758
01:01:05,096 --> 01:01:11,596
それぞれ誓った 踊って作るわ
Dancing and creating what each of us swore to do.

759
01:01:13,596 --> 01:01:17,596
ありがとう おまるポルカでした！
Thank you, this was Omaru Polka!

760
01:01:17,596 --> 01:01:21,096
ポルカ午後におるよ！
Polka will be here in the afternoon too!

761
01:01:21,096 --> 01:01:24,096
ポルカからもよろしくね！
Please keep supporting Polka!

762
01:01:25,096 --> 01:01:28,596
イェーイ！イェーイ！
Yay! Yay!

